MIT covers the code in this package. It does not cover the three binaries in `assets/`, which are a
third-party build of `f2c` and `libf2c` under their own notice - THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md reproduces it
and records where they came from.

The Clang half of the toolchain is not in this package at all: it is `@live-codes/clang-wasm`'s, and
that package carries its own notices.

